  "solution": {
    "text": "The binding energy of nucleus may be defined as the energy equivalent to the mass defect of the nucleus.<br /><br />If <math><mo>∆</mo><mi>m</mi></math> is mass defect than according to Einstein's mass energy relation.<br /><br />Binding Energy<br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>∆</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>1.00783</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>7</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>1.00867</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>14.00307</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1124</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>931.5</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>MeV</mi></math><br /><br />or <math> <mrow>  <mtext>BE</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>104.6</mn><mtext>&#x2009;</mtext><mtext>MeV</mtext></mrow></math>",
